 for punchlines, and clean modern white sans-serif for story paragraphs.\n• Composition: Clean negative space placement, zero artificial , zero clip art, high-status auteur editorial magazine art direction.\n\n=== [SLIDE 6 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 6 of 8 (CHEATSHEET)\nCard Counter Tag: \"06 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"SAVEABLE CHEAT SHEET\"\nMain Headline: \"5 copy-paste viral hook templates.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"viral hook templates, save this\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Save these 5 proven hook archetypes for your next video shoot:\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"1. The Cost Confession: \"I spent $X so you can skip to $0.\"\"\n  2. \"2. The Contrarian: \"Why [common habit] is ruining your [desired result].\"\"\n  3. \"3. The Withheld Reveal: \"I found the 1 tool that actually works (not what you think).\"\"\n  4. \"4. The Juxtaposition: \"Why putting [luxury item] in [gritty street] went viral.\"\"\n  5. \"5. The 3-Minute Fix: \"How to fix [big headache] in 1 click.\"\"\nCallout Box: \"💾 SAVE THIS POST: Use these 5 templates whenever you write your next hook!\"\nBottom Prompt: \"THE 15S RETENTION CURVE →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\n\n=== [SELF-CHECKER STRICT FIDELITY ENFORCEMENT] ===\nMandatory Reference Visual Signatures: Ensure the output strictly incorporates: clean sans-serif.\nDo not deviate from the reference image's visual composition and materials."
