tramway windows, raw brutalist architectural juxtaposition).\n• Banana Pro Director 3.0 Cinema Stack: 35mm anamorphic prime lens, directional raking key light casting deep Abyss Black (#0A0A0C) shadow wells, authentic subsurface scattering, genuine fabric weave, subtle volumetric haze, flattering-realism ceiling (fine lived-in pore texture, zero plastic CGI sheen, zero artificial beauty filters).\n• Typography System: Crisp white (#FFFFFF) Playfair Display high-contrast editorial serif headline layered with clean Archivo narrative copy.\n• Swiss HUD Framing: Clean micro-metadata in Archivo 300 / Mono stamps (\"05 // CIEL DOCTRINE // SPEC 2026.01\") floating cleanly in negative space.\n• Zero Gimmicks: No clip art, no emojis, no neon sticker badges. Pure auteur luxury cinema authority.\n\n=== [SLIDE 5 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 5 of 8 (STEP3)\nCard Counter Tag: \"05 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"SECRET 3\"\nMain Headline: \"Auteur lighting: rejecting the commercial studio gloss.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"auteur lighting, deep shadow wells\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Real cinema lighting embraces deep shadow wells and natural raking light.\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"Abyss Black (#0A0A0C) shadow wells create dramatic negative space\"\n  2. \"Directional raking light sculpts form without plastic AI sheen\"\n  3. \"Subtle volumetric mist and 35mm grain add cinematic depth\"\nCallout Box: \"LIGHTING LAW: Deep shadows give light its authority and prestige.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"THE SAVEABLE SPEC →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen."
