          "prompt": "Use this image as reference to create a graphic carousel slide in the EXACT same visual style, replacing all copy with the following slide content:\n\n=== [REFERENCE STYLE SPECIFICATION] ===\n• Style Name: Ciel Auteur Cinematic Storytelling\n• Genre: Auteur Photographic Storytelling & Narrative Carousels\n• Background: Full-bleed 4:5 rich authentic 35mm film photography: vibrant lifestyle/travel scenes (striped umbrellas, vintage Mediterranean light), everyday surrealist street moments (subway car, rain-soaked asphalt), luxury tactile product macros in use, simple relatable moments of tension and creative effort (messy desk with steaming coffee, hands typing late at night, pouring morning espresso), organic cowhide texture, and diverse global lifestyle settings (modern loft studios, gallery terraces, Tokyo cafes).\n• Header & Navigation: Pure minimalism: Zero fake UI frames, zero , zero box containers. Clean crisp white text floating directly over the photographic negative space.\n• Typography Hierarchy: Playfair Display + Lato Photographic Narrative Hierarchy:\n• Slides 1 & 6 (Hook & Climax): Massive stacked high-contrast Playfair Display Serif in pure crisp white (#FFFFFF) with tight line-height.\n• Slides 2, 3, 4, 7 (Story & Narrative Body): Clean, modern Lato sans-serif in pure white, placed top-left or bottom-left with natural line breaks.\n• Slide 5 (Tension & Stakes): Lato body copy paired with a Playfair Display Serif punchline.\n• Spacing & Punctuation: Natural editorial rhythm with deliberate commas and zero artificial container boxes.\n• Color Palette & Containers: Authentic 35mm photographic palettes: Mediterranean cobalt blue & candy stripes, moody urban subway teal & charcoal, warm amber rain coat, rich cognac crocodile leather, tactile brown-and-white cowhide, and golden sunset amber, text: #FFFFFF pure crisp white text overlay, colors: Natural photographic negative space contrast, High-contrast Playfair serif punchlines\n•  & Accents: Zero , zero clip art, zero geometric blobs. Pure auteur photographic authority where the photograph carries the emotion and the typography delivers the narrative.\n• Lighting & Finish: Authentic 35mm film stock, natural sunlight, warm directional golden hour light, rain-streaked glass refractions, and real tactile material textures.\n\n=== [AUTEUR PHOTOGRAPHIC STORYTELLING DIRECTIVE (COPIED FROM REFERENCE CAROUSEL)] ===\n• Slide 1 Scene Archetype (The Visual Hook): Full-bleed striking 35mm film photograph of vibrant lifestyle/travel scenery (e.g. red and white striped resort umbrellas under palm trees against a deep blue sunny sky, Mediterranean summer light, rich film grain).\n• Slide 1 Typography: Pure crisp white (#FFFFFF) high-contrast luxury editorial serif (Playfair Display / Ogg). Massive stacked text with tight leading centered directly over the photo negative space. Zero boxes, zero badges, zero .\n\n=== [SLIDE 1 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 1 of 8 (HOOK)\nCard Counter Tag: \"01 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"BRAND STORYTELLING\"\nMain Headline: \"Your brand needs to tell a story.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"brand, story\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Why origin stories fail, and how customer transformations build billion-dollar brands.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"SWIPE FOR THE STORY →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\n\n=== [SELF-CHECKER STRICT FIDELITY ENFORCEMENT] ===\nMandatory Reference Visual Signatures: Ensure the output strictly incorporates: full-bleed photo, white typography.\nDo not deviate from the reference image's visual composition and materials.",
