ents: Zero , zero clip art, zero geometric blobs. Pure auteur photographic authority where the photograph carries the emotion and the typography delivers the narrative.\n• Lighting & Finish: Authentic 35mm film stock, natural sunlight, warm directional golden hour light, rain-streaked glass refractions, and real tactile material textures.\n\n=== [AUTEUR PHOTOGRAPHIC STORYTELLING DIRECTIVE (COPIED FROM REFERENCE CAROUSEL)] ===\n• Slide 2 Scene Archetype (The Anti-Pattern): Auteur cinematic surrealist urban photograph (e.g. a man in a dark jacket, cap, and glasses ironing a white shirt inside a moving subway car, moody teal & charcoal color grading, everyday surrealism).\n• Slide 2 Typography: Clean modern white Lato sans-serif in two separate left-aligned blocks floating top-left and bottom-left directly over the photo.\n\n=== [SLIDE 2 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 2 of 8 (PROBLEM)\nCard Counter Tag: \"02 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"THE ORIGIN TRAP\"\nMain Headline: \"Most brands tell a story about themselves.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"about themselves, see themselves\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Founder journey. Company values. How it all started.\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"Founders spend 10 minutes talking about their childhood garage ideas\"\n  2. \"Audiences scroll past self-centered origin timelines\"\n  3. \"People do not buy who you were; they buy who they become with you\"\nCallout Box: \"Customers don't care how you got here. They care whether they see themselves in what happens next.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"THE 10-MINUTE PITCH →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\n\n=== [SELF-CHECKER STRICT FIDELITY ENFORCEMENT] ===\nMandatory Reference Visual Signatures: Ensure the output strictly incorporates: 