ents: Zero , zero clip art, zero geometric blobs. Pure auteur photographic authority where the photograph carries the emotion and the typography delivers the narrative.\n• Lighting & Finish: Authentic 35mm film stock, natural sunlight, warm directional golden hour light, rain-streaked glass refractions, and real tactile material textures.\n\n=== [AUTEUR PHOTOGRAPHIC STORYTELLING DIRECTIVE (COPIED FROM REFERENCE CAROUSEL)] ===\n• Slide 5 Scene Archetype (Simple & Relatable Everyday Tension): Simple, authentic, relatable human/everyday moment of tension or effort (e.g. a creative work table with a steaming ceramic coffee mug next to crumpled notebook sketches and glasses, or hands typing late at night on a laptop illuminated by a warm table lamp, or someone sitting on a wooden bench at a rainy bus stop with an umbrella, or pouring morning coffee on a sunlit wooden kitchen counter). Natural warm lighting, grounded everyday simplicity, authentic 35mm film texture.\n• Slide 5 Typography: Centered or left-aligned white Lato sans-serif body copy resolving into a high-contrast Playfair Display serif punchline.\n\n=== [SLIDE 5 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 5 of 8 (STEP3)\nCard Counter Tag: \"05 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"SECRET 3\"\nMain Headline: \"Most 'brand stories' skip the tension entirely.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"skip the tension, stakes\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"No conflict. No stakes. No reason to keep watching.\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"Without real tension, a story is just a dry chronological timeline\"\n  2. \"Show the obstacle, the frustration, the high-stakes friction\"\n  3. \"When tension is resolved, trust and loyalty are unlocked\"\nCallout Box: \"NARRATIVE LAW: A story without a problem is just a timeline.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"THE GOLDEN PUNCHLINE →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\n\n=== [SELF-CHECKER STRICT FIDELITY ENFORCEMENT] ===\nMandatory Reference Visual Signatures: Ensure the output strictly incorporates: full-bleed photo, white typography.\nDo not deviate from the reference image's visual composition and materials.",
