ents: Zero , zero clip art, zero geometric blobs. Pure auteur photographic authority where the photograph carries the emotion and the typography delivers the narrative.\n• Lighting & Finish: Authentic 35mm film stock, natural sunlight, warm directional golden hour light, rain-streaked glass refractions, and real tactile material textures.\n\n=== [AUTEUR PHOTOGRAPHIC STORYTELLING DIRECTIVE (COPIED FROM REFERENCE CAROUSEL)] ===\n• Slide 6 Scene Archetype (The Climax / Universal Law): Full-bleed organic material texture macro (e.g. natural brown-and-white cowhide fur with authentic hair grain and tactile texture).\n• Slide 6 Typography: Massive stacked Playfair Display serif headline in pure crisp white (#FFFFFF) with tight leading centered over the organic texture.\n\n=== [SLIDE 6 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 6 of 8 (CHEATSHEET)\nCard Counter Tag: \"06 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"THE CHEAT SHEET\"\nMain Headline: \"Nobody remembers your founding story.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"transformation, got to be part of\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"They remember the transformation they got to be part of.\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"1. Hook: Agitate their current unresolved problem\"\n  2. \"2. Mirror: Reflect the internal frustration they feel daily\"\n  3. \"3. Guide: Offer the proven vehicle and actionable path forward\"\n  4. \"4. Identity: Celebrate the new identity they step into\"\nCallout Box: \"💾 SAVE THIS POST: The 4-Part Brand Transformation Architecture.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"THE 3-STEP FRAMEWORK →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\n\n=== [SELF-CHECKER STRICT FIDELITY ENFORCEMENT] ===\nMandatory Reference Visual Signatures: Ensure the output strictly incorporates: full-bleed photo, white typography.\nD