ents: Zero , zero clip art, zero geometric blobs. Pure auteur photographic authority where the photograph carries the emotion and the typography delivers the narrative.\n• Lighting & Finish: Authentic 35mm film stock, natural sunlight, warm directional golden hour light, rain-streaked glass refractions, and real tactile material textures.\n\n=== [AUTEUR PHOTOGRAPHIC STORYTELLING DIRECTIVE (COPIED FROM REFERENCE CAROUSEL)] ===\n• Slide 7 Scene Archetype (Diverse Cinematic Setting & Organic CTA): Diverse, atmospheric cinematic lifestyle scene in an authentic global setting (e.g. diverse creative founders in an airy brutalist loft studio with floor-to-ceiling city views, modern gallery rooftop terrace at dusk, an intimate minimalist Tokyo cafe corner with warm lantern light, or architectural urban pavilion). Natural warmth, diverse subjects, cinematic 35mm depth of field.\n• Slide 7 Typography: Minimalist 2-line white Lato sans-serif call-to-action placed cleanly at the bottom-left over negative space.\n\n=== [SLIDE 7 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 7 of 8 (SUMMARY)\nCard Counter Tag: \"07 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"WORKFLOW\"\nMain Headline: \"The 3-Step Story Engine\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"story engine, catalyst\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"How to write high-converting brand stories in under 5 minutes:\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"1. Define the Old World (Pain, Friction, Antiquated methods)\"\n  2. \"2. Introduce the Catalyst (The new vehicle, philosophy, or tool)\"\n  3. \"3. Reveal the New World (Status elevation, speed, freedom)\"\nCallout Box: \"✈️ SHARE WITH A FOUNDER: Help someone stop telling boring origin stories!\"\nBottom Prompt: \"CLAIM THE STORY PLAYBOOK →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\