Flat 2D graphic vector print design, razor-sharp typography, zero 3D rendering, zero realistic drop shadows.\n\n=== [GREEN AMOEBA BLOB DIRECTIVE] ===\n• Center: Giant vibrant green 8-point amoeboid starburst blob (#22C55E) dominating the layout.\n• Typography: Heavy bold condensed black grotesque headline on top-left, and beaded chain-link numbers (\"08\") on bottom-left.\n• Metadata: Tilted oval badge with arrow, BMOP pill, and typewriter definition paragraph with smiley stamp.\n\n=== [SLIDE 8 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 8 of 8 (CTA)\nCard Counter Tag: \"08 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"FREE PRIZE\"\nMain Headline: \"want the free automated dm funnel blueprint?\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"funnel blueprint, free setup guide\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Drop a 1-word comment below and I will instantly DM you the complete setup guide!\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"💬 Comment \"SALES\" on this post right now\"\n  2. \"📥 Automated DM sends the complete 2-minute OpenReply setup guide + scripts\"\n  3. \"🚀 Follow @junnbuilds / project\\ciel for daily visual directing & automation secrets\"\nCallout Box: \"⚡ Instant free delivery: Drop \"SALES\" below to get the download link.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"COMMENT \"SALES\" NOW ↓\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.",
