          "prompt": "Use this image as the exact visual template (scene environment, camera angle, physical props, and layout structure) to create a faithful variation branded specifically for project\\ciel.\n\n=== [5-LAYER STRUCTURAL PROMPT SPECIFICATION] ===\n\n1. SUBJECT LAYER\n• Primary Subject: Natural, authentic, approachable young creative founder / designer / model with genuine expression.\n• Pose & Attire: Grounded, high-taste. Styled in effortless, relatable creator wardrobe (clean heavyweight black cotton tee, relaxed overshirt, minimalist crewneck, or clean black blazer with relaxed pants).\n• Physical Props/Interactive Objects: Recreate featured objects/props from the reference image, adapted to spell \"CIEL\" or \"STORY\".\n\n2. ENVIRONMENT LAYER\n• Location Type: Playful Y2K Editorial Grid Collage\n• Scene Setting: Recreate the EXACT core scene concept, background setting, and spatial layout of the reference image.\n• Background Details: Clean white graph grid notebook paper with subtle technical grey grid lines.\n\n3. LIGHTING LAYER\n• Primary Source: Studio cinematic photography lighting or natural environmental lighting matching the reference image.\n• Light Quality & Direction: Clean flat even studio lighting, subtle soft drop shadows under stickers and text, razor-sharp vector typography, zero blur.\n• Caustics: Warm Golden Amber caustics and natural shadows catching surfaces.\n\n4. TECHNICAL / CAMERA LAYER\n• Camera Perspective: Recreate the exact camera angle, framing, and lens perspective of the reference image.\n• Format: 1080 x 1350 vertical aspect ratio (4:5 safety frame), high-status editorial layout.\n• Technical Spec: Razor-sharp focus, professional lens render, flat 2D graphic layout alignment.\n\n5. STYLE / AESTHETIC LAYER\n• Genre: Swiss Brutalist & Haute-Couture Campaign art direction.\n• Typography System: Large stacked high-contrast editorial serif headline with tight leading and bold lowercase contrast.\n• Color Palette: Abyss Black (#0A0A0C) shadow wells, Crisp White (#FFFFFF) text, Muted Platinum (#E2E2E8) accents, Studio Slate (#141418), and colors: #FCE7F3 pastel pink highlighter bar, #DCFCE7 pastel lime green, #BAE6FD pastel blue\n• Stickers & Decals: Playful floating 3D micro-stickers and icons: glossy red cherries 🍒, disco ball 🪩, lightning bolt ⚡, flying cash 💸, retro pixel mouse cursors 🖱️, and speech bubble cards.\n• Metadata & Framing: Integrate \"// project\\ciel · AUTEUR DIRECTING\", \"[CIEL · 2026]\", and header/nav style: Minimalist top app navigation: \"< project\\ciel.\" on top-left, \"☰ 🔍 +\" icons on top-right in black.\n\n=== [SLIDE 1 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 1 of 8 (HOOK)\nCard Counter Tag: \"01 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"HIGGSFIELD CINEMA SPEC\"\nMain Headline: \"how to direct 4k product videos with real fluid physics.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"4k product videos, fluid physics\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Stop making stiff robot AI videos. Here is how to add weight, bounce, and cinematic motion.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"SWIPE FOR CAMERA MOVES →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\n\n=== [SELF-CHECKER STRICT FIDELITY ENFORCEMENT] ===\nMandatory Reference Visual Signatures: Ensure the output strictly incorporates: pill tag.\nDo not deviate from the reference image's visual composition and materials.",
