          "prompt": "Use this image as the exact visual template (scene environment, camera angle, physical props, and layout structure) to create a faithful variation branded specifically for project\\ciel.\n\n=== [5-LAYER STRUCTURAL PROMPT SPECIFICATION] ===\n\n1. SUBJECT LAYER\n• Primary Subject: Natural, authentic, approachable young creative founder / designer / model with genuine expression.\n• Pose & Attire: Grounded, high-taste. Styled in effortless, relatable creator wardrobe (clean heavyweight black cotton tee, relaxed overshirt, minimalist crewneck, or clean black blazer with relaxed pants).\n• Physical Props/Interactive Objects: Recreate featured objects/props from the reference image, adapted to spell \"CIEL\" or \"STORY\".\n\n2. ENVIRONMENT LAYER\n• Location Type: Streetwear Product Concept / Physical Hero Object\n• Scene Setting: Recreate the EXACT core scene concept, background setting, and spatial layout of the reference image.\n• Background Details: Pure solid white studio backdrop with zero background clutter.\n\n3. LIGHTING LAYER\n• Primary Source: Studio cinematic photography lighting or natural environmental lighting matching the reference image.\n• Light Quality & Direction: Studio macro photography lighting, soft natural contact shadow, authentic physical skin texture, razor-sharp 50mm clean prime.\n• Caustics: Warm Golden Amber caustics and natural shadows catching surfaces.\n\n4. TECHNICAL / CAMERA LAYER\n• Camera Perspective: Recreate the exact camera angle, framing, and lens perspective of the reference image.\n• Format: 1080 x 1350 vertical aspect ratio (4:5 safety frame), high-status editorial layout.\n• Technical Spec: Razor-sharp focus, professional lens render, flat 2D graphic layout alignment.\n\n5. STYLE / AESTHETIC LAYER\n• Genre: Swiss Brutalist & Haute-Couture Campaign art direction.\n• Typography System: Heavy condensed grotesque sans-serif in solid black, layered behind and in front of the central physical object.\n• Color Palette: Abyss Black (#0A0A0C) shadow wells, Crisp White (#FFFFFF) text, Muted Platinum (#E2E2E8) accents, Studio Slate (#141418), and colors: #A3E635 neon lime recycling badge, #C084FC purple monster decal\n• Stickers & Decals: Central physical hero object completely covered in graphic streetwear decals, circular brand stamps, purple monster cartoon sticker, and green recycling icon.\n• Metadata & Framing: Integrate \"// project\\ciel · AUTEUR DIRECTING\", \"[CIEL · 2026]\", and header/nav style: Stacked bold grotesque headline in background (\"Hungry(O'Clock) Packaging Concept\") with fine copyright stamps (\"©2025 Blender (mdr)\").\n\n=== [AI VISUAL PROMPT COOKBOOK STYLE DIRECTIVE: ACID LIME 3D STREETWEAR TYPE POSTER STYLE] ===\n\n=== [SLIDES 2-8: VALUE UNDERSTANDING & VISUAL CLARITY DIRECTIVE] ===\n• MAXIMUM READABILITY & DIAGRAMMATIC CLARITY: Slide 5 MUST clearly communicate step-by-step educational value and technical frameworks with 9-year-old clarity.\n• HIGH-CONTRAST DATA CARDS: Use clean, high-contrast container cards, 0.5px architectural grid lines, bulleted checklists, and structured callout boxes.\n• NO CLUTTER: Zero visual clutter, zero messy overlaps. Keep generous negative space around headline text and key takeaways.\n• VISUAL DIAGRAMS: Transform complex concepts into clean step-by-step visual flows, before-and-after split cards, or 3-step action blueprints.\n\n=== [SLIDE 5 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 5 of 8 (STEP3)\nCard Counter Tag: \"05 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"SECRET 3\"\nMain Headline: \"Pillar 3: Cultural Narrative.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"cultural narrative, mythology\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Every visual must carry an unspoken story and cultural point of view:\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"Do not sell product specs; broadcast a cultural philosophy\"\n  2. \"Align your brand with timeless human values: craft, courage, transformation\"\n  3. \"Create artifacts that people want to 