sans-serif in lowercase (Futura/Helvetica style, e.g. \"things\", \"they seem\") layered with dramatic, melted psychedelic ink-drip liquid cursive calligraphy in solid black (e.g. \"aren't\", \"what\").\n• Color Palette: Abyss Black (#0A0A0C) shadow wells, Crisp White (#FFFFFF) text, Muted Platinum (#E2E2E8) accents, Studio Slate (#141418), and colors: #FF9EE2 bubblegum pastel pink, #5C7CFA electric periwinkle cobalt blue\n• Stickers & Decals: 2 large stepped/pixelated contour polygon cutout containers with thin 1px black outline borders framing the text. 90-degree rotated vertical margin labels (\"PLACEBO\", \"BURGER QUEEN\"), and micro-type definition blocks.\n• Metadata & Framing: Integrate \"// project\\ciel · AUTEUR DIRECTING\", \"[CIEL · 2026]\", and header/nav style: Minimalist top metadata bar: \"05 NOV OF 25TH\" on top-left, \"WEDNESDAY\" in center, \"8.37 PM\" on top-right in crisp uppercase sans-serif.\n\n=== [AI VISUAL PROMPT COOKBOOK STYLE DIRECTIVE: ACID LIME 3D STREETWEAR TYPE POSTER STYLE] ===\n\n=== [SLIDES 2-7: VALUE UNDERSTANDING & VISUAL CLARITY DIRECTIVE] ===\n• MAXIMUM READABILITY & DIAGRAMMATIC CLARITY: Slide 3 MUST clearly communicate step-by-step educational value and technical frameworks with 9-year-old clarity.\n• HIGH-CONTRAST DATA CARDS: Use clean, high-contrast container cards, 0.5px architectural grid lines, bulleted checklists, and structured callout boxes.\n• NO CLUTTER: Zero visual clutter, zero messy overlaps. Keep generous negative space around headline text and key takeaways.\n• VISUAL DIAGRAMS: Transform complex concepts into clean step-by-step visual flows, before-and-after split cards, or 3-step action blueprints.\n\n=== [SWISS ACID STEPPED-POLYGON DIRECTIVE] ===\n• Top Island: 1 stepped/pixelated contour polygon cutout with thin 1px black outline filled with Bubblegum Pastel Pink (#FF9EE2). Contains primary headline word in clean geometric sans layered with liquid melted black script.\n• Bottom Island: 1 stepped/pixelated contour polygon cutout with thin 1px black outline filled with Electric Cobalt Blue (#5C7CFA). Contains secondary words in clean geometric sans & liquid black cursive script.\n• Peripheral Metadata: Top header timestamp (\"05 NOV // SLIDE 03\"), vertical rotated 90-degree margin tags (\"PROJECT\", \"CIEL\"), and floating tiny micro-copy paragraphs in negative space.\n\n=== [SLIDE 3 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 3 of 8 (STEP1)\nCard Counter Tag: \"03 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"STEP 01: THE GRID\"\nMain Headline: \"step 1: pick a grid reference layout.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"grid reference, layout\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Never start from scratch. Upload a graphic poster you love to guide the structure.\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"Choose a poster with bold stacked typography and clean grid lines\"\n  2. \"Let Nano Banana analyze the spacing, fonts, and color contrast\"\n  3. \"Keep the background minimal (off-white graph grid or deep black)\"\nCallout Box: \"PRO TIP: Reference images act as the blueprint for your typography.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"STEP 2: THE PROMPT →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\n\n=== [SELF-CHECKER STRICT FIDELITY ENFORCEMENT] ===\nMandatory Reference Visual Signatures: Ensure the output strictly incorporates: stepped polygon, bubblegum pink, melted liquid calligraphy, warm-grey canvas.\nDo not deviate from the reference image's visual composition and materials.",
