, luxury brand formula\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Save this slide for your next luxury brand campaign:\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"• Color Palette: Abyss Black (#0A0A0C) + Crisp White (#FFFFFF)\"\n  2. \"• Typography: Playfair Display Serif + Swiss Archivo 300 HUD Stamps\"\n  3. \"• Lens Doctrine: 35mm / 50mm prime, natural depth plane separation\"\n  4. \"• Texture Rule: Flattering-realism ceiling, fine lived-in pores, fabric weave\"\nCallout Box: \"💾 SAVE THIS POST: The Master Physical Luxury Directing Formula.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"THE 3-MINUTE WORKFLOW →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\n\n=== [SELF-CHECKER STRICT FIDELITY ENFORCEMENT] ===\nMandatory Reference Visual Signatures: Ensure the output strictly incorporates: tilted pill sticker.\nDo not deviate from the reference image's visual composition and materials.",
